 "description": "The required loop rate is written as 2000 Hz, with an extra zero; it should be 200 Hz, the rate the balance loop, estimator, odometry and scheduler all follow. A 2000 Hz balance requirement is almost ten times the 208 Hz IMU output data rate that feeds the loop and above the LSM6DS33's highest gyroscope rate of 1666 Hz. It leaves 8000 cycles of the 16 MHz AVR per update. No design of this robot can meet it.",
